Incidentally, since a number of people have mentioned it, I don't take
caffeine, either.  I may take aspirin once every six months or so, but
I have allergies, so I take antihistamines a few times a day during
certain times of year or when I go to a house that has cats in it.
I've never noticed these having any mental effect.  The only
