reading this list :) ... I am making none, or some, or all, of
the above up. I'm not telling you which bits are true and which are
false. And this in no way constitutes an admission that I have either
broken the law, or intend to break the law, or wish to encourage
anyone else to do so.

Draw your own conclusions.



